### CorA (Corpus Annotator)
{: class="first-heading"}

CorA is a web-based annotation tool for word-level annotation of historical and
other non-standard language data, written in PHP and JavaScript and using a
MySQL back-end.

There is a [separate website dedicated to
CorA](http://www.linguistics.rub.de/comphist/resources/cora/) with more
information.
{:.alert.alert-info}
